# fa-portal — no environment configuration is required.
#
# This server reads nothing from the environment: `grep process.env src/`
# returns no matches. The file is kept only so that this stays documented.
#
# In particular, the following are NOT used and must not be set:
#
#   FA_EMAIL / FA_PASSWORD  Login is interactive only. The server never stores
#                           credentials; you log in through a real browser
#                           window and only the resulting bearer token is kept,
#                           in the macOS Keychain.
#
#   FA_HEADLESS             Removed. The login browser is always visible,
#                           because a human has to complete the login.
#
# If you find a .env in a checkout of this repo, it is left over from an older
# version and should be deleted.
